<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">- Zeme(N) Bible Project</book>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">1 Peter</para>
  <para style="toc1">Peter ne Raukegai Laisiu Keraibe</para>
  <para style="toc2">Peter Keraibe</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Pet.</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Peter</para>
  <para style="mt">Peter ne Raukegai Laisiu Keraibe</para>
  <para style="is">Mraisam</para>
  <para style="ip">Peter keraibe de Peter ne raugai, pa Jisu gu ledeukelume hangge, Asia minor nreulebie lunghkela Khristianme dage kekai laisiu. Khristianme aidungde de penui kenlum ziemne teikeherei bamla, cine Peter penuide teingkuu eh raugai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pa penuide Jisu daikenzwage penui ziemne keherei beubi nsung lulo nah Tinggwang penui mapie beu kerade nlum eh pe puisau de mzui lulo beu. Tinggwang penuide pe mina teikera kedet kelune nah Jisu penui ziemne keherei nah tsai kebeune, Peter Khristianme aidungde de kemci teilung lungh lulo eh ranggai. Pa penuide dainzwa eh kemau deu aika Khristianme tei eh lungh lubui bi nah aipaucai ziemne keregui bam lubui bi ranggai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Pelung ga keladung</para>
  <para style="io1">Kelumkegai (1:3-12)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kemci teilung (1:13-2:12)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kenlumme teilung (2:13-4:11)</para>
  <para style="io1">Keherei bata ketei (4:12-5:11)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kekambe (5:12-14)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1" />
  <para style="s">Keraisam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1" />Peter, Jisu Khrista ne langkegaibe ne laisiu raupwa Tinggwang minadung sangme zangra riepkela, kedet kelumedung, Pontus, Galatia, Cappadocia, Asia nah Bithynia deuceudung dage kekai. <verse eid="1PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2" />Aide Peibe Tinggwang cinswa kebam rehi gade, Rabe ne teu ntsamlu samzai ketei ziemne nah Jisu Khrista jai le huimci kelu ziemne. Peu ngaugia nah lungciep nnuida bamsi kelube tei lulo.<verse eid="1PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ringkebam keregui ziemne Tinggwang de ketwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3" />Peu Tinggwang nah anui Rampaube Jisu Khrista Peibe de hetwa pungkelube tei lulo! Pe ngaugia kedi ziemne, pa Jisu Khrista de ketsai gade ringcuh daikelu gade anuide teilung keheci nah kering keregui peu dida. <verse eid="1PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4" />Aide gumlu kera ziemne anui rimdi kelak, nah hera dilak, nah huidi gailak. Cide nnui ziemne tinggim gage kaizeu. <verse eid="1PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5" />Nnui kenlum gade Tinggwang kengkieng ne nnuide gum pwa bam, peting kekamle de kelikelu de keulia kera mtei teu kela ziemne. <verse eid="1PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6" />Cine nnui suiyi kesang lu. Miswakegah suiyi nnui dwaga bamlu. Keherei ketsamtsam nnui tingkakge lialu maisiadi liede. <verse eid="1PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7" />Aide nnui kenlum kesang mi mebi kecu pie kerane, cide au gahdi kela kecak swade pemi hung. Dede cide mi le ru kedakpie liede, nnui kenlum, Jisu Khrista mi miakngau tei kegwangbe nai ketwa, kendu nah herüt ngau luzie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 23:10">Job 23:10</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 66:10">Lei. 66:10</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 48:10">Isa. 48:10</ref>, <ref loc="JAS 1:12">Jas. 1:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8" />Nnui Jisu de ngau melie de, nnui pecu hung. Nnui cu pecu ngau melie de, nnui pecu nlum nah suiyi rang kapgai kelak le nnui sui yila nah kendu le puila. <verse eid="1PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9" />Nnui kenlum ziemne nnui rabe de kelikelu ngaulu bamdi delu. <verse eid="1PE 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10" />Kelikelu aipau ha de Caihakecimedung peei nah keteu sünne gwang, nah ngaugia de nnui gu kera mrai rang. <verse eid="1PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11" />Penui pei kecu tei caune ziebi cilu kerane nah Khrista Rabe penuida kebamde penuide mpaubam kecudau. Rabe penuide Khrista keherei kera ha nah pecai kendudung gwang kerabe mrairang beu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 1:21">2 Pet. 1:21</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 52:13-14">Isa. 52:13-14</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 24:25-27">Luk. 24:25-27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12" />Cide penui dage liagai penui au penui mmi ziemne malie kecu, dede nnui ziemne, tinggim gade langkegai Kemci Rabe ne nnui dage samliakeyi ledeu kebamme ne cu nnui dage rang kebeude penui resiu kebamdau, aidungde tinggimgwame de ci neu eh pie gwang.<verse eid="1PE 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mci lu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13" />Cine nnui kecet mteilwe bamlu, Mriaklu, nnui keregui ngaugia gage kai cangsiak lu cide Jisu Khrista de liagai kecudau nnuide peuzie. <verse eid="1PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14" />Samzai ketei Tinggwang name nzwa, nnui ci kemak tingdau nnui ndaa luukeneu lungningdung caisui diso. <verse eid="1PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15" />Dede nnuide qu kelube mci kecu nzwa, nnuide, nnui zaireli leune gade mci lulo. <verse eid="1PE 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16" />Ainzwa raupwa kela ziemne: “Nnui mci luzie, kedanemene Ih au mci lu.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 11:44">Lev. 11:44</ref>;<ref loc="LEV 19:2">19:2</ref>;<ref loc="LEV 20:7">20:7</ref></char></note><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aja kai kebeude cai, penui pe mina lie kecu rangla, nah pe mina nzwa kelu penui penui Tinggwang nzwa zielie eh </char></note> <verse eid="1PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17" />Cine nnui “Peibe” de qucai heneu-herüt tei mene nah mina ketket bata rehi gade hetutiak kelabe de, nnui hebeuh teikela tane pecu rüt eh tet sünne lu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 19:7">2 Hel. 19:7</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 28:4">Lei. 28:4</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 59:18">Isa. 59:18</ref>, <ref loc="JER 3:19">Jer. 3:19</ref>;<ref loc="JER 17:10">17:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18" />Nnui gahdi kela rangkanggeu mede kecak nnui peime kemie zai gade kelilu kemak nnui cibam.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 49:7-8">Lei. 49:7-8</ref>, <ref loc="GAL 1:4">Gal. 1:4</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 52:3">Isa. 52:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19" />Meliene, nnuide au pemi kehung Khrista jai le kelilu da, pa au meurünna zamra mede pegiak kegahbe nzwa. <verse eid="1PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20" />Pecu kideu bangdwa kemakne gade kedet luda, dede nnui ziemne peting kekamle aide gade liagai bam. <verse eid="1PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21" />Pe dade nnui Tinggwang de nlum luda, pecu ketsai gade kwakcuh kelube nah pecu kendu peu, iciu eh nnui kenlum nah keregui Tinggwang da lalu kerane. <verse eid="1PE 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22" />Nnui kesangbe samzai teikelu gade nnui de teimci luda. Aide au siname keku lungsang ngau kera ziemne; cine hangge gede nnui mlung mci eh lungsang gade kereku lulo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">kesa kehegwa laisiudung ga </char><char style="fqa">Rabe gade nnui kesangbe samzai teikelu gade nnui rabe tei mcilu bam </char> </note> <verse eid="1PE 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23" />Gahdi kela heleuh gade ma, dede madaude gahdi kelak heleuh gade, kering nah bammui kela Tinggwang sam gade, nnuide mna hecidai luda. <verse eid="1PE 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24" />Kesanglaisiu rang kela nzwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:24">“Pumteih leune au cehei nzwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:24">nah pe kendu pelane au cehei mapa nzwa lie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:24">Ceheibang ki dila, nah mapa hui dila,<verse eid="1PE 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25" />dede Rampaube sam au kelungta bamla.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 16:17">Luk. 16:17</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 1:1">Jhn. 1:1</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 40:8">Isa. 40:8</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 1:25">Sam aide samliakeyi nnui dage pwa kepeude da.<verse eid="1PE 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1" />Ciziemne hezai kesia, nah kemret leune nah hezai ketei nah mide swak kecu, nah mide rangkemsia pelane gi dilu. <verse eid="1PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2" />Ngenadung nzwa, rabe tungdui kemcibe hengin lulo, iciu eh cide gade nnui kelikelu ga mmi cuhlu kerane, <verse eid="1PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3" />magade nnui Rampaube au yilie kecu msilu delie cai.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:8">Lei. 34:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ringkebam tsurakang nah kedetkelu leuh ge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4" />Peda gwang lulo, pa kering tangtsube da, mina ne gi kedibe, dede Tinggwang ne kedet kelube pe dade pemi kehungbe. <verse eid="1PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5" />Nnui de kering tangtsudung nzwa delie, rabe ki zielie eh teikelube, kemci cingkuleuh ge Jisu Khrista gade Tinggwang luulu kebui pwapeu rabe ratakdung teilu kerane. <verse eid="1PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6" />Ciziemne kesanglaisiu rang kela nzwa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:6">“Ainie, Ih Zion gage kimiaktsu ge kaigai zeulie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:6">kedetlu nah pemi kehung ge.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:6">Pecu nlumlukelube depeu hengam tei dilak.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Isa. 28:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7" />Nnui nlum kelume ziemne au, tangtsu aide pemi hung. Dede nlum kemakme ziemne au,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:7">“heta keteime ne gi kedi tangtsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:7">aide au kimiak ga pe peube tei dida”, <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Lei. 118:22</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8" />nah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:8">“Mipi nrap kera tsu ge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:8">nah penuide teingkaudi kela tsura ge.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 2:8">Penui sambe nlum kemak ziemne penui kaudi, penui depeu iciudi kera riem pwala dida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:14-15">Isa. 8:14-15</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 1:23">1 Cor. 1:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9" />Dede nnui au kedetkelume, hegwang cingkuleuh ge, heleuh kemci ge, Tinggwang minadung, iciu eh Tinggwang ne nnuide kemui gade qu mpet mimakecangh pe kebaa gage kai kelube bata keyidung nnui mi dage ranglialu kerane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:5-6">Tet. 19:5-6</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 7:6">Hez. 7:6</ref>;<ref loc="DEU 14:2">14:2</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 43:20-21">Isa. 43:20-21</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10" />Ndaa au nnuide masipei ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:10">dede cu au nnui Tinggwang mina dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:10">Piage nnui ngaugia ngau luma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:10">dede cu au nnui ngaugia ngau luda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 1:10">Hos. 1:10</ref>;<ref loc="HOS 2:23">2:23</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11" />Akumedung, Ih nnuide qu gaila sangme nah langgi kedimedung nzwa pumteih kehegin gade mbai kerane, cide nnui rabe de ngngwa hereu tei kelane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:24">Gal. 5:24</ref>, <ref loc="1PE 4:2">1 Pet. 4:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12" />Nnui Gentileme kakga zai keyi teu eh bamlu maisia, iciude, magade penui nnui ma kesia keteime lie de rangcai, penui nnui bata keyidung ngauzie nah Tinggwang kegwang benai pecu twa zie.<verse eid="1PE 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kedime nah mpaume sam kemzai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13" />Rampaube ziemne mina peuteu kecume leune samzai teilu. Hegwangpei ne ngkiengtube tei bam liede, <verse eid="1PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14" />nah deuceudidung de, pane langgai eh kesia keteime de saja peu nah keyi keteime de hetwa peu kerane, <verse eid="1PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15" />kedanemene aide Tinggwang lungning da: heta keyi ketei gade maci kemakme kemie samdung kaamdi kera. <verse eid="1PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16" />Suirang keteime nzwa, n suirang teu eh makesia gum diso, dede Tinggwang kilame nzwalu. <verse eid="1PE 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17" />Mina pelane de rütlu. Kenlumme dungde kulu. Tinggwang mie hinglu. Hegwangpei de rütlu.<verse eid="1PE 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18" />Kilamedung, nnui mpaumedung kangga lunghlu herüt peu sünne eh. Keyi nah kenciep mpaume kangga rünne mene, kesiame dungde de si eh. <verse eid="1PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19" />Kedanemene cide au hetwa punglu kebuige magade keheibede keteei lia lucai keherei buikemak gade keherei keladau pa Tinggwang de cikela ziemne. <verse eid="1PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20" />Kedanemene nnui kemau tei eh nnuide saja kepeudau lialu liecai daipai kemmi bam no? Dede nnui makeyi tei gai eh keherei lialu liecai, cide au Tinggwang dade hetwa punglu kebuige. <verse eid="1PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21" />Aide gage nnuide qugai luda, kedanemene Khrista de nnui ziemne kehereibeu. Pa nnui ziemne puisau ge teibeu iciu eh pe caisuilu kerane.<verse eid="1PE 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22" />“Pa kemau teima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:22">mede pe mui gade kecwa sam gede ngau luma.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:9">Isa. 53:9</ref>, <ref loc="2CO 5:21">2 Cor. 5:21</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23" />Khrista de kesiu kecudau, pa kesiugwa ma. Pa keherei keludau, pa keheugwa ma, dede pa mige kesangbe gade hetutiak kelabe de nlum beudi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:7">Isa. 53:7</ref>, <ref loc="1PE 4:19">1 Pet. 4:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24" />Pa pekatei pe pum gade anui maudung cross gage pung, iciu eh anui kemau ga ncütdi kelakne, nah anui kesamsang ziemne lungh kerane. Pe rejam jamdung ne nnuide teingkei luda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:4-5">Isa. 53:4-5</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 53:12">12</ref>, <ref loc="GAL 3:13">Gal. 3:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25" />Kedanemene nnui meurün lampui cita kedibe nzwa tetla dida, dede cu nnui meurün kekwabe nah nnui rabe mapie kelabe da cailigwang luda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:6">Isa. 53:6</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 34:5-6">Eze. 34:5-6</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3" />
  <para style="s">Nau henah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1" />Ainzwa eh, nnui mi naumedung nnui nahpei samzai teilu. Mi nahpei kangge samliakeyi samzai teilu meliede, penui naume zairelidung gade, ma gede rang meliede penui naume ziemne ngkieng lubui, <verse eid="1PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2" />kedanemene penui nnui zai kesamsang de ngau eh herüt peuzie. <verse eid="1PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3" />Penui hegwale hezu ketei depeu mede nnui tam kepwa, nah kecaknia kekai, mede cudau keteunia dungde gage nnui lung kai diso. <verse eid="1PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4" />Meliene, peu cide de nnui lung gade rimdi kelak mizai kenciep nah ziune kecu rabe gage kailu, cide Tinggwang dwade au pemi hung süt. <verse eid="1PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5" />Kedanemene aide nzwa eh ndaa mipui kemcime Tinggwang de penui regui eh penui kateide hezu teihemi eh, penui nahpeidung kangga lungh gwang. <verse eid="1PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6" />Ainzwa eh Sarah au Abraham sam mzailu delwe pecule pe mpaube le qulu. Magade nnui yilie kecube tei lacai nah nnui keherei kecu hing meliecai nnuide cu pe name dida.<verse eid="1PE 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7" />Cinzwa eh, nnui nahpeidung nnui naude au mnei kecu pui gelie de ci eh, ngngwa kelungnzwa eh lunghlu maisia. Nnui penuide herüt peulu maisia, ngaugia kering mapeu dega ngngwa hemaa ge kecu nzwa. Aide teilu iciude nnui kekiedung kaamdi melu kerane.<verse eid="1PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Keyi keteine keherei kecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8" />Dede kamtube, nnui pelane macet ga ket teilu, kengaugia eh, siname keku nzwa, milung nciep, nah henah lu. <verse eid="1PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9" />Kesiabe le kesiabe pwa peu daiso mede kesiugwa so. Ciu meliene, samlam jüja lalu, kedanemene aide ziemne nnuide qu luda, nnuide peu samlam ngaulu kerane.<verse eid="1PE 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10" />Kesanglaisiu rangkela nzwa, “Keringria de kula keneume nah tingba keyi ngau keneume</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:10">makesia kerang gade pe mleu nah pe muileu mide kecwa sam kerang gade pecu kezeulu maisia.<verse eid="1PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11" />Dede peu pecu kesiabe gade nreutet dilu delwe daipai yibi teilu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:11">Peu pecu kezuyibe peeilu nah cide gwalu.<verse eid="1PE 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12" />Rampaube au samsang kelame de piela, nah penui kekiedung kingnei bamla.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:12">Dede pa kesia keteime de ngkau la.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:15-16">Lei. 34:15-16</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 9:31">Jhn. 9:31</ref>, <ref loc="PRO 15:29">Mac. 15:29</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13" />Nnui makeyibe teineu lacai caune nnuide tei rejam laino? <verse eid="1PE 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14" />Dede nnui makesang ziemne keherei liede, nnuide samlam beuzie. Dede penui keheu kecu de ngngi, mede nnui lung keherei diso. <verse eid="1PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15" />Meliene, nnui mlung gade Khrista de Rampaube lie eh herüt peulu. Kedanemene mi keheibede n dade nang Tinggwang de regui kela kie cide keteucai keli beu kera mtei teula muilu. <verse eid="1PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16" />Dede aide henah eh herüt teu eh teilu. Nnui lungcet de peu mci bamlu iciude penui nnui rangmsia kecudau, Khrista gade nnui zai keyide rang kemsiame dungde de peu ngngam dilu kerane. <verse eid="1PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17" />Kedanemene Tinggwang lungning liecai, nang ma keyi ketei ziemne keherei kecube au kesia ketei ziemne swa cide yiki. <verse eid="1PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18" />Kedanemene Khrista de kemaudung ziemne piage keherei. Pa au kesamsangbe anui masang kemakme ziemne keherei, ciu eh pa anuide Tinggwang da ngngwa gwanglu kerane. Pecu pumteibe gade teitset di, dede Kemci Rabe gade pecu teimring dailu. <verse eid="1PE 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19" />Cine pa hebaangki ga mie delwe rabedung dage zierang tei. <verse eid="1PE 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20" />Noah tingdau Tinggwang pe lung ketie de teu kwabam ge penui ndaa samzai teima, liem ketei tingdau, Tinggwang cikade mina kecam nage, keringria hangheset de, dui gade keli lu. <verse eid="1PE 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21" />Aide au cu nnuide duipum gade kelikelu rehi de saukelia, cide pumteih kehera huigidi kecu de ma, dede Tinggwang dage kecet keyi kiekegai ge, Jisu Khrista ringcuh daikelu gade. <verse eid="1PE 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22" />Khrista Tinggwang ba zetle bam dida. Pa tinggim ga gwang dida. Pe dage Tinggimgwame, nah kengkieng keteumedung pe kangga lunghlu maisia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:20-21">Eph. 1:20-21</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 110:1">Lei. 110:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4" />
  <para style="s">Tinggwang ziemne lungh kebam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1" />Khrista pumteihbe gade keherei beu kecu nzwa, nnuide cinzwalu kera cetlu. Kedanemene keheibede Khrista ziemne pumteihbe ga keherei luge kemau teita dila. <verse eid="1PE 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2" />Ciziemne, ring kebamtane, mina lungningbedung ga lungh lakta, dede Tinggwang lungningbe ga lungh zie. <verse eid="1PE 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3" />Ndaa nnui Gentileme tei neu kela kenlien, kemmha, zausak kemie, nah mamie recadung tei süt dida. <verse eid="1PE 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4" />Nnui cu penuide ngngwa nlwang kecu teilung ga la sita kedine penui swagah nah nnuide kesiu ladi. <verse eid="1PE 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5" />Dede penui katei penui ha pwa keringme nah ketsaime tutiak kerabe de peuzie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:1">2 Tim. 4:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6" />Cine aide ziemne samliakeyibe pwa tsaikedimede de ledeu, iciu eh penuide mina pumteihbe rehi gade tiak kebeu nzwa eh, penui rabe kilam ga Tinggwang ring kela nzwa peu penuide ringlu kerane.<verse eid="1PE 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7" />Dede ma pelane penlibe nna gwangla dida. Cine nnui mring nah nnui mriak eh kie bamlu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:8">Jas. 5:8</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 6:18">Eph. 6:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8" />Bamkeraide nnui kereku recakdi mene kereku lu, kedanemene keku kemau kekiee gumlu lalu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 10:12">Mac. 10:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9" />Ncamdi mene ketket de ngaungngia lu. <verse eid="1PE 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10" />Hangge ge mapeu ngau kelu nzwa, cide ketket de ngha kera ziemne teulu, Tinggwang ngaugia ketsam tsam kenlum gade teu heta teilu. <verse eid="1PE 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11" />Mige marang lacai, peu Tinggwang samdung gade ledeulu. Mige ngkwet keteime cai, peu Tinggwang pecu kepeu kengkieng de teu nkwet lu. Aidungde teilu ciu eh ma pelane gade Jisu Khrista gade Tinggwang depeu ndulu kerane. Peu Jisu Khrista da ketwa nah kengkieng kelungta bam kelube tei lulo. Amen.<verse eid="1PE 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khristianme keherei kecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12" />Akumedung, nnuide kedet kera kehedei kegwang dau, nnuida ma ketsam ge kegwang nzwa nnui swagah diso. <verse eid="1PE 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13" />Meliene, daikiee ge nnui Khrista reide ga ngngwa rei labi, nnui suiyilu, iciu eh nnuide pe kendu mi miakngau tei eh kegwang daude nnui sui yilu kerane. <verse eid="1PE 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14" />Magade nnuide Khrista zi ziemne mi kesiu lacai, nnui au samlam kepungme da, kedanemene kendu Rabe Tinggwang rabe nnui reuga kebamne.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:11-12">Mat. 5:11-12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15" />Dede peu mi gede de mide dap ketset, mede kerega, mede heta kesia ketei mede mide kehebwakme gade peu keherei so. <verse eid="1PE 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16" />Dede mi keheibe de khristianme kecune keherei lacai, peu pecu ngngam diso, meliene, pecu peu cipau zi dele Tinggwang de tei ndulu. <verse eid="1PE 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17" />Tinggwang name dade hetutiak ndeu di kera ting nna zeuda. Magade cide anui dade teicuh dicai, Tinggwang samliakeyi de nlum kemakmedung dainzwa dilai?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:24-25">Heb. 12:24-25</ref>, <ref loc="JER 25:29">Jer. 25:29</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 9:6">Eze. 9:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18" />Nah “Magade makesangbe ziemne kelikelu teipa cai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 4:18">masang kemakme nah kemau keteime dainzwa dilai?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 11:31">Mac. 11:31</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19" />Cine, Tinggwang lungning gade keherei kebamme depeu makeyi teilu nah damkegaibe samsangkelabe Tinggwang dage penui teilung de nlum gaibeu dilu.<verse eid="1PE 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5" />
  <para style="s">Kecingme nah hename dage kerang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1" />Ih hangkiame ge kecu nzwa nnui kakga hangkiamedung de kecung gaila: Ih Khrista keherei kebeu zierangme ge, nah Ih de kendu keulia gai kera ga ncüt kerame ge zie. <verse eid="1PE 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2" />Nnuida kebam Tinggwang meurün hau ma pielu, kerengeime ge nzwa heta tei eh, nnui teibi maisia lu de kecu ziemne so, dede nnui neungga eh kebamne lu, Tinggwang peu nnuide teineu kela nzwa, hengam gie ziemne mene dede teineu kesang kecu gade teilu. <verse eid="1PE 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3" />Nnui minadung mapie kebamme reu dikecu ciem teiso. Meliene, meurün hau dage saulia ge teilu. <verse eid="1PE 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4" />Iciude meurün kekwa kedibe mi miakngau tei kegwangdau, nnui siadi kelak hetwa kepung peurwa ngau luzie. <verse eid="1PE 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5" />Cinzwa eh, nnui henamedung, kecingme samzai teilu. Nnui pelane, nnui paini kenciep teu eh hangge ge gwatei lulo, kedanemene Tinggwang ngang kecume de pesui lama, dede pa henah kecume de ngaugia peula.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:34">Mac. 3:34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6" />Cine Tinggwang ba kengkiengbe kang gade nnuide teihenah lu iciude peting siak dau pa nnuide teucuh beuzie. <verse eid="1PE 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7" />Nnui lungrei pelane pwa Tinggwang de peu dilu, kedanemene pa nnui mapie lalu. <verse eid="1PE 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8" />Mriak lu, kwabam lu. Nnui ngauraube, herakesiabe, hingho kemra nzwa nsau twagwa bam, mina kang gade tui tyei zielie peei eh. <verse eid="1PE 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9" />Pecu renialu, nnui kenlum ga ntiprip lu. Kedanemene nnui kideu pelane gade kenlummedung de keherei cikenzwa dau kap eh liakegwang cibam delu. <verse eid="1PE 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10" />Dede nnui kakge keherei gai lude, ngaugia pelane Tinggwang nnuide Khrista gade pe kelungta kendu gage qugai kelube ne nnuide teimmi, tei ntip nah teingkieng beuzie. <verse eid="1PE 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11" />Peda peu kelungta kengkiengbe bam kelube tei lulo. Amen.<verse eid="1PE 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kelumkegai kekambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12" />Ih pecu anui zangbe makesangme gelie kela Silvanus ngha teu eh, nah Ih rau ndui eh nnui dage raugai. Ih nnuide kerau gade Tinggwang ngaugia kesangbe delie kecu zierang tei eh kecung gaila. Cika sap ntiplu. <verse eid="1PE 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13" />Nnuide ngngwa kedetkelu Babylon ga ngqwa, nah a na Mark de si eh, nnuide kelum gaila. <verse eid="1PE 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14" />Ket ket de keku hemam teu kelum lu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 5:14">Khrista ga kebam nnui pelane da peu kezuyi de bam kelube tei lulo.<verse eid="1PE 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5" />
</usx>